---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/global/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/global/Footer.astro';
import Container from '../../../components/global/Container.astro';
import Section from '../../../components/global/Section.astro';
import TechnicalLabel from '../../../components/global/TechnicalLabel.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Gallery Manager | AionSi" description="Private AionSi event gallery management area.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-surface-alt)] py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-24"><Container><TechnicalLabel>PRIVATE GALLERY MANAGER</TechnicalLabel><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-7xl">Manage event media without editing website code.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-600">This management area is the front-end foundation for event creation, photo/video upload, captions, cover selection and publish controls.</p></Container></Section>
    <Section><Container><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8"><TechnicalLabel>EVENT MANAGEMENT</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Create an event</h2><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4"><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Event title<input class="mt-2 w-full rounded border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3" placeholder="e.g. DVCon India 2026" /></label><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Category<select class="mt-2 w-full rounded border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3"><option>Conference</option><option>Exhibition</option><option>Technical Event</option><option>Company Event</option></select></label><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Date<input type="date" class="mt-2 w-full rounded border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3" /></label><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Location<input class="mt-2 w-full rounded border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3" placeholder="Bengaluru, India" /></label></div><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Description<textarea class="mt-2 min-h-32 w-full rounded border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3" placeholder="Describe the event and AionSi participation."></textarea></label><button type="button" class="w-fit rounded-full bg-[var(--aionsi-orange)] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Save draft</button></div></div><div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8"><TechnicalLabel>MEDIA WORKFLOW</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Upload media</h2><div class="mt-6 grid gap-5"><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Photos<input type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple class="mt-2 block w-full rounded border border-slate-300 p-3" /></label><p class="text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">Recommended: optimized JPG/WEBP. Original large files should remain in persistent media storage rather than GitHub.</p><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Videos<input type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/webm" multiple class="mt-2 block w-full rounded border border-slate-300 p-3" /></label><p class="text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">For large videos, use persistent Hostinger storage or an external media bucket. Do not commit videos to the repository.</p><label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Cover image<input type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" class="mt-2 block w-full rounded border border-slate-300 p-3" /></label><div class="rounded border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-900">Upload actions are intentionally not wired to storage yet. Before enabling them, configure authenticated admin access and a persistent media storage path on Hostinger so media survives redeployments.</div></div></div></div></Container></Section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
